{
  "name": "@sparstrow/views",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "_comment": [
    "Feature UI per domain, mirroring packages/core one-to-one.",
    "A view knows @sparstrow/core (data) and @sparstrow/ui (primitives).",
    "It must NOT know which app is rendering it: no next/*, no electron,",
    "no router import. Navigation arrives as props.",
    "",
    "Exports SOURCE, not a build (AGENTS.md §1 rule 3)."
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.ts",
    "./*": [
      "./src/*.tsx",
      "./src/*.ts",
      "./src/*"
    ]
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "vitest run"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@sparstrow/core": "workspace:*",
    "@sparstrow/shared": "workspace:*",
    "@sparstrow/ui": "workspace:*",
    "lucide-react": "catalog:"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@tanstack/react-query": "catalog:",
    "react": "catalog:"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@sparstrow/tsconfig": "workspace:*",
    "@tanstack/react-query": "catalog:",
    "@types/react": "catalog:",
    "react": "catalog:",
    "typescript": "catalog:",
    "vitest": "catalog:"
  }
}
